  "label": "Trump is mapped as someone who can't swing a bat",
  "description": "The text 'trump can't swing it' is mapped onto Donald_Trump's visual representation. The meme uses the idiom 'can't swing it' (implying inability to swing a bat) to metaphorically suggest Trump lacks physical strength or competence, which is visually reinforced by the juxtaposition with the image of a man holding a bat. The mapping is established by the text explicitly referring to Trump and the visual material depicting him in a context that implies physical inadequacy.",
